* ---------------------------------------- save area for local data ----
* sju 2001-07-10           (211578) NOTE:
* L-SCREEN-SAVE-AREA is written to the Natural stack when RLIACF has to
* fetch another program, so that the screen can be rebuilt on return.
* The maximum size of the Natural stack is 3072 characters. A set of
* flags is also stacked so the maximum effective length of L-SCREEN is
* 3042 bytes. If this is exceeded, the user will get a NAT1605 error.
*
* fhi 2001-08-20           (213288) NOTE:
* Solution only worked for administrator users, general users still got
* the error. Save-area once more reduced.
* fhi 2010-02-12 N3460 NOTE:
* The maximum size of the Natural stack is now unlimited. However, only
* up to 999 elements can be pushed to the stack. Now I try to get rid
* of it: The data are no more stacked but programs fetched with return.
*
1  L-SCREEN
  2 L-SCREEN-SAVE-AREA
    3 L-SCR                (1:#NOFLINES)
      4 L-MARK             (A2)
      4 L-IDENT            (I2)
      4 CV-MARK            (C)
      4 CV-LINE            (C)
      4 L-OWNER            (L)
      4 L-REPORT           (A25)
      4 L-DESC             (A50)
      4 L-MAIL-DATE        (A8)
      4 L-MAIL-TIME        (A5)
      4 L-CREATION-DATE    (A8)
      4 L-CREATION-TIME    (A5)
      4 L-EXPIRATION-DATE  (A8)
      4 L-RNB              (P11)
      4 L-LINES            (A8)
      4 L-SOURCE-SENDER    (A33)
      4 L-CONFIRM          (A10)
      4 L-ARCHIVE          (A1)
      4 L-REVIVE           (A1)
      4 L-LOC              (A1)
      4 L-SOURCE-ID        (P10)
      4 L-BIN              (L)
      4 L-OPTION           (A1/6)
    3 #F-KEYTAB            (1:#NOFPAGES) /* 42 * 11 = 462
      4 #F-KEY             (A42)
      4 REDEFINE #F-KEY
        5 #F-FOLDER        (A10)
        5 #F-REPNAME       (A25)
        5 #F-TIME-INV      (P13)
      4 REDEFINE #F-KEY
        5 #F-KEY2          (A17)
        5 REDEFINE #F-KEY2
          6 #F-USER-ID     (A8)
          6 #F-FO-ID       (B2)
          6 #F-INV-TIME    (P13)
        5 #F-RNB           (P11)
      4 REDEFINE #F-KEY
        5 #F-SOURCE        (A16)
